msgstr ""
"Dine tildelinger omfatter Flyt musemarkøren. Slå dette til for at lade dem "
"flytte systemets musemarkør, mens eov har fokus."

#. Translators: "Move Pointer" stands for the actions "Move Pointer
#. Horizontally" and "Move Pointer Vertically"; Remote Desktop and
#. Accessibility are the names of system permissions: write them as
#. the system shows them in your language
#: src/ui.rs:237
msgid ""
"Off. When on, Move Pointer mappings move the system pointer while eov has "
"focus. Wayland asks for Remote Desktop permission and macOS for "
"Accessibility access."
msgstr ""
"Fra. Når funktionen er slået til, flytter tildelinger til Flyt musemarkøren "
"systemets musemarkør, mens eov har fokus. Wayland beder om tilladelse til "
"Remote Desktop og macOS om adgang til Tilgængelighed."

